{"unit_id":"cdxiaodong__dsh-island#card-zh","repo":"cdxiaodong/dsh-island","commit":"62699999e0ccc46b191d5c46b5f0679a463ac097","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-island 是一款供 macOS 桌面使用的 DSH 插件，可将会话与 agent 状态送到菜单栏原生面板。插件监听会话创建和结束、工具调用前后、子代理启停及 agent 状态，并通过本机 Unix socket 更新面板；审批请求可在面板中允许或拒绝，决策返回 DSH。面板还支持显示插件列表和菜单项，其他插件可注册托盘菜单操作。适合希望在桌面上查看 DSH 运行进度并处理审批的用户。无需 API key 或外部账号；需要 macOS 面板及本机 socket 通信。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:102-159","src/index.ts:192-220","src/index.ts:229-245","panel/SocketServer.swift:157-180"]}
{"unit_id":"cdxiaodong__dsh-island#card-en","repo":"cdxiaodong/dsh-island","commit":"62699999e0ccc46b191d5c46b5f0679a463ac097","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-island shows DSH sessions, tool activity, subagents, and status in a macOS menu bar panel. It forwards approval requests for decisions in the panel and lets other plugins add tray actions. It uses a local Unix socket and needs the bundled macOS panel; no API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:102-159","src/index.ts:192-220","src/index.ts:229-245","panel/SocketServer.swift:157-180"]}
