{"unit_id":"cdxiaodong__dsh-island#feature-1","repo":"cdxiaodong/dsh-island","commit":"62699999e0ccc46b191d5c46b5f0679a463ac097","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-island 的功能「会话与工具状态面板」：把会话开始/结束及工具调用前后事件通过本机 socket 发送给面板。插件自动监听相应 DSH 生命周期和工具事件。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:102-120","src/index.ts:165-190"]}
{"unit_id":"cdxiaodong__dsh-island#feature-2","repo":"cdxiaodong/dsh-island","commit":"62699999e0ccc46b191d5c46b5f0679a463ac097","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-island 的功能「面板审批」：将 DSH 审批请求转发到 macOS 面板，并等待用户决策；允许或拒绝结果会映射回 DSH，未收到决策时交给后续处理器。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:192-220"]}
{"unit_id":"cdxiaodong__dsh-island#feature-3","repo":"cdxiaodong/dsh-island","commit":"62699999e0ccc46b191d5c46b5f0679a463ac097","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-island 的功能「托盘插件管理」：面板请求插件列表时读取运行时 registry，并支持通过控制 socket 启用或关闭插件。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:247-282","src/index.ts:296-345"]}
{"unit_id":"cdxiaodong__dsh-island#feature-4","repo":"cdxiaodong/dsh-island","commit":"62699999e0ccc46b191d5c46b5f0679a463ac097","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-island 的功能「其他插件菜单项」：其他 DSH 插件调用 registerMenuItem 添加托盘菜单操作，返回的注销函数可移除该菜单项。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:223-245"]}
{"unit_id":"cdxiaodong__dsh-island#caveat-1","repo":"cdxiaodong/dsh-island","commit":"62699999e0ccc46b191d5c46b5f0679a463ac097","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-island 使用本机 Unix socket 传递 DSH 事件与审批决策，面板启动时也会设置 socket 路径；实现面向 macOS 原生面板。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:389-410","src/socket.ts:87-99"]}
